The OpenRAM importer modifies the views by extracting cells and parent routing,
translating coordinates, merging polygons, adding canonical pins and boundaries,
flattening/renaming circuit nodes, joining annotated through-pins, and converting
CDL devices to the PDK simulation-model interface. Array overlays separate frame
geometry from individually instantiated storage cells. See import_sram.py and
README.md for the transformations and supported assembly constraints.
